  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "✨Introducing ~ Prime Thyme<br><br>It's Thyme to get away! Prime Thyme is the ultimate place to host your next family and friend's getaway. This spacious 7-bedroom, 8-bath retreat sleeps up to 24 guests and is packed with features made for fun—from a custom ping-pong table and luxury grill area to a rooftop balcony and private backyard… and that's just the beginning. Read on below for more to love at 'Prime Thyme'! <br><br>Fall in love with ~ <br>- 7 bedrooms and bunk area, all with ensuite bathrooms. Perfect for each family to have space to unwind. <br>- Complimentary 6-seater golf cart. Cruise into Seaside's Central Square in under 5 mins.<br>- 6 Custom Heron bikes <br>- Rooftop lounge with plenty of seating and gulf views from three different angles.<br>- Private heated pool and hot tub, with tanning deck and outdoor shower. Plus, plenty of loungers! <br>- Luxury outdoor grilling area and mini fridge. Bring the kitchen to you! <br>- It's game time - challenge family and friends with the custom ping pong table<br><br>It's a beautiful day in the neighborhood. Where you'll call home ~ <br>- Nested between Seagrove and Seaside (only a 3-minute drive to town center). <br>- Seaside Town Center is the place to be on 30A. With an abundance of great restaurants and shopping it's easy to spend all day exploring this hot spot. Don't miss Pickles or Bud & Alley's - two 30A favorites. P.S: Make sure to check out all the spots you might have seen in a certain movie! 👀<br>- 5 Minute walk or 2 min bike ride to Dogwood-Thyme Beach Access.<br>- Around the corner from~ local favorites like Pizza by the Sea, Seagrove Village Market, Cafe ThirtyA and The Perfect Pig.<br><br>Step Inside ⇨<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- The double queen bedroom is located right off the entry and does feature an ensuite bathroom with a walk-in closet.<br>- Walk right into the first floor living area featuring the custom-made ping-pong table make this THE hang out spot for this breathtaking home.<br>- Step out in the luxury outdoor grilling area and round up the chef's in your group. Time to grill! <br>- Pool lounge is perfect for a cannon ball contest, lounging with the family, or taking a break in the hot tub. <br>- Rounding out the space is the double over double bunk area with a door that leads out into the private backyard just past through Ensuite bathroom. This area also features a stacked washer and dryer combo in the closet.<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- Walk right up into the spacious open concept living area. With plenty of comfy seating entertaining nights in with the whole family will be unforgettable.<br>- Pull up a seat at the dining table that seats up to 10, the kitchen island that seats 4, or take it outside on the balcony. With a spot for everyone enjoying homecooked meals will be the go-to!<br>- Kitchen goals - high end Thermador appliances are featured including an oversized fridge and gas range. Plus, this kitchen comes with a butler's nook with a drink cooler and ice maker to whip out cocktails and vacation vibes.<br>- Right off the kitchen is the King bedroom with a private balcony and ensuite bathroom. <br>- Also located on this floor is the second Double over Double bunk room with ensuite bathroom.<br><br>THIRD FLOOR<br>- The TV loft area is the highlight of this floor with a dry bar featuring an ice maker and drink cooler. <br>- The stairs to the rooftop balcony are right off the Tv loft area as well!<br>- Right behind the dry bar is the laundry room with an ironing board and full-size washer and dryers.<br>- The primary king bedroom offers a private balcony and the primary En suite was designed to make you feel like you are at the spa. With the double vanity and large shower with soaking tub, how could you not be in total relaxation?<br>- There are 2 King bedrooms with En suites on this floor as well. <br>- Don't forget the double queen bedroom with an En suite as well!<br><br>🛏️For Rest:<br>Floor 1: Double Queen Bedroom with Ensuite<br>Floor 1: Double over Double Bunk Area with Ensuite<br>Floor 2: King Bedroom with Private Balcony and Ensuite<br>Floor 2: Double over Double Bunkroom with Ensuite<br>Floor 3: Primary King Bedroom with Primary Ensuite and Private Balcony<br>Floor 3: King Bedroom and Ensuite<br>Floor 3: King Bedroom with Ensuite<br>Floor 3: Double Queen Bedroom with Ensuite<br><br>The Essentials. All included in your stay ~ <br>- Beach gear; toys, a beach cooler, and cornhole. <br>- Beach towels, beach umbrella, and chairs also provided.<br>- Two laundry rooms for ultimate convenience. <br>- Elevator for ease getting between floors. <br>- Premium full-size bath products in every bathroom/kitchen We provide body wash, shampoo, conditioner, lotion, and hand soap.<br>- Starter Kit: We start you out with essentials like paper towels, toilet paper, dish soap, and laundry pods. <br>- Coffee Time! Fuel up in the mornings with our complimentary coffee and Keurig.<br><br>✏️Other Things to Note<br>- Parking: The driveway can fit up to 5 cars comfortably. <br>- Minimum age to rent the home is 25. <br>- Pets: Apologies, no furry friends are allowed at the home. We appreciate your understanding on this.<br>- Vacation disruptions can be a bummer. While it doesn't happen often, you may experience issues with Wi-Fi. We are not responsible for any disruptions to the Wi-Fi service or any construction that may affect your experience. Please note that such occurrences are beyond our control, and we appreciate your understanding and patience in these matters. <br><br>This home is proudly managed by Kalos Dwellings. Please reach out if we can help answer any questions for you. <br>STR24-001671",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
